  "visual_differences": [
    "All views use native font metrics, antialiasing, tracking, palette, HUD widths and borders, trust fill and control spacing.",
    "v01, v09 and v10 retain native map outlines, marker halos and place-bar dimensions. The v01 and v09 native bars are wider, and v10 covers more of the canal caption. v01 retains the prayer, payment and fasting order. v09 retains both prayer and breaking the fast. v10 retains prayer.",
    "v02–v04 and v06–v08 use the native dark Masjid lane of placeholder walls and paving. The master street has detailed buildings, lanterns, bricks and a moon. Panel heights, row offsets, lines, button widths, colours and border opacity differ slightly. v02, v06 and v08 wrap the introduction after ‘the’.",
    "v03, v04 and v07 are captured after the pointer has left the paid option, so that button uses its normal fill. The v06 and v07 native checked box is grey, and its icon and spacing differ from the blue master checkbox.",
    "v05 uses the live daytime Masjid camera, native walls and visible player capsule. The master uses a detailed day market background. The reputation panel has slightly different height, type, row, footer and button spacing.",
    "v08 retains two right-aligned insufficient-funds labels with native font metrics."
